function [o, u] = gyro_sample(u, d, w, dt)
%GYRO_SAMPLE  The rate the gyro reads [rad/s] for the true body rate w [rad/s] over a step dt [s].
%   u: inout GyroUnit (passed rec)
%   d: GyroDesc (passed rec)
